{
  "DESCRIPTION": "XY phosphor scope: L drives X, R drives Y, drawn as a Gaussian electron beam with persistence, bloom and a hot white core. HUD instrument look: thin lines in a bracketed panel, dashed grid, tick rulers with numerals, readouts, field-colour variants. HUD instrument look: thin lines in a bracketed panel, dashed grid, tick rulers with numerals, readouts, field-colour variants. HUD instrument look: thin lines in a bracketed panel, dashed grid, tick rulers with numerals, readouts, field-colour variants. HUD instrument look: thin lines in a bracketed panel, dashed grid, tick rulers with numerals, readouts, field-colour variants. HUD instrument look: thin lines in a bracketed panel, dashed grid, tick rulers with numerals, readouts, field-colour variants",
